（頭部・尻尾など切れないこと）。\nキャラと背景を分けて納品（キャラのみ／背景のみ）していただけると嬉しいです。\n\n【参考資料】\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dkzdxfsaGVjZZ14u9ze1ZlNWEz9WxdX8?u\n【キャラクター詳細】\nhttps://x.com/Amagam_Neko\namagamneko.wixsite.com/kimineko\n\n以上になります。\nご検討いただけますと幸いです。\nご縁がありましたらよろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@af48668/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3790951, "client_id": 234985, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=775ca07a185ac54c7d5642c002e4956f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=775ca07a185ac54c7d5642c002e4956f, https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=865330eec7d1a843ae943f7a50d7acf8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c96de390f92a33f8789810e9b4258cd 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff1dc946309ed5a8e39cdb3d4043240d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff1dc946309ed5a8e39cdb3d4043240d, https://si.imgix.net/182fefd6/uploads/origins/5d7141fe-b67a-478c-a770-49200d1ddbcc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&f